// Tech Spanish ↔ Tech English glossary: the single source of truth.
// build.mjs turns this into glossary.json (clean data), flashcards.json
// (the games' card shape) and GLOSSARY.md (the readable document).
//
// Entry fields (keep them short; build.mjs expands them):
//   id     slug, unique within the glossary
//   en     English term
//   es     Spanish term(s) a careful writer would use
//   reg    [formal document, casual with the team, slang] — null when none
//   region Spain vs Latin America difference, when there is a real one
//   work   what people really say at work (often the English word)
//   ex     [English example, Spanish example]
//   ff     false-friend warning, when relevant
//   note   free text, or a key into NOTES (which points to SOURCES)
//   lvl    1 beginner · 2 intermediate · 3 advanced (for flashcards)

